alf-ice. 10U\, 12U\, &amp\; 14U will practice half-ice and play full-ice games.&nbsp\;</span></p>\n<p style="box-sizing: inherit\; margin: 0px\; color: #5e5e5e\; font-family: Roboto\, arial\, sans-serif\; font-size: 16px\;"><span style="box-sizing: inherit\;">&nbsp\;</span></p>\n<p style="box-sizing: inherit\; margin: 0px\; color: #5e5e5e\; font-family: Roboto\, arial\, sans-serif\; font-size: 16px\;"><span style="box-sizing: inherit\;"><span class="x-el x-el-span c1-2c c1-2d c1-b c1-9e c1-3m c1-5n c1-9f" style="box-sizing: inherit\; letter-spacing: inherit\; text-transform: inherit\; color: inherit\; font-weight: bold\; line-height: inherit\; font-size: inherit !important\;">USA HOCKEY MEMBERSHIP:</span> All players are required to register annually with USA Hockey for the existing playing season. Online registration can be completed at usahockey.com.</span></p>\n<p style="box-sizing: inherit\; margin: 0px\; color: #5e5e5e\; font-family: Roboto\, arial\, sans-serif\; font-size: 16px\;"><span style="box-sizing: inherit\;">&nbsp\;</span></p>\n<p style="box-sizing: inherit\; margin: 0px\; color: #5e5e5e\; font-family: Roboto\, arial\, sans-serif\; font-size: 16px\;"><span style="box-sizing: inherit\;"><span class="x-el x-el-span c1-2c c1-2d c1-b c1-9e c1-3m c1-5n c1-9f" style="box-sizing: inherit\; letter-spacing: inherit\; text-transform: inherit\; color: inherit\; font-weight: bold\; line-height: inherit\; font-size: inherit !important\;">TOLEDO WALLEYE VOUCHER FUNDRAISER:</span> Each registered player will receive five (5) Toledo Walleye game vouchers. The cost of the vouchers is included in the BBHL player fee. Families may use their vouchers or re-sell them at face value.&nbsp\;</span></p>\n<p style="box-sizing: inherit\; margin: 0px\; color: #5e5e5e\; font-family: Roboto\, arial\, sans-serif\; font-size: 16px\;"><span style="box-sizing: inherit\;">&nbsp\;</span></p>\n<p style="box-sizing: inherit\; margin: 0px\; color: #5e5e5e\; font-family: Roboto\, arial\, san