SUMMARY:🏒 Drop-In/Pickup – Sylvania\, OH
DESCRIPTION:<p style="box-sizing: inherit\; margin: 0px\; color: #5e5e5e\; font-family: Roboto\, arial\, sans-serif\; font-size: 16px\;"><span style="box-sizing: inherit\;">Get ready for a season filled with camaraderie\, skill development\, and memorable experiences on and off the ice! The Buckeye Broadband Hockey League (BBHL) is sponsored by Buckeye Broadband. Players receive a Buckeye Broadband game jersey\, and game sox. Regular season runs late September thru mid March. The majority of the ice touches will be at Sylvania Tam-O-Shanter. There will be a few ice touches at Ottawa Park.&nbsp\;</span></p>\n<p style="box-sizing: inherit\; margin: 0px\; color: #5e5e5e\; font-family: Roboto\, arial\, sans-serif\; font-size: 16px\;"><span style="box-sizing: inherit\;">&nbsp\;</span></p>\n<p style="box-sizing: inherit\; margin: 0px\; color: #5e5e5e\; font-family: Roboto\, arial\, sans-serif\; font-size: 16px\;"><span style="box-sizing: inherit\;"><span class="x-el x-el-span c1-2c c1-2d c1-b c1-9e c1-3m c1-5n c1-9f" style="box-sizing: inherit\; letter-spacing: inherit\; text-transform: inherit\; color: inherit\; font-weight: bold\; line-height: inherit\; font-size: inherit !important\;">RATE SKATE:</span> All players are required to attend a rate skate in September. The rate skate is NOT a tryout for the BBHL. All registered players will be placed on a team.</span></p>\n<p style="box-sizing: inherit\; margin: 0px\; color: #5e5e5e\; font-family: Roboto\, arial\, sans-serif\; font-size: 16px\;"><span style="box-sizing: inherit\;">&nbsp\;</span></p>\n<p style="box-sizing: inherit\; margin: 0px\; color: #5e5e5e\; font-family: Roboto\, arial\, sans-serif\; font-size: 16px\;"><span style="box-sizing: inherit\;"><span class="x-el x-el-span c1-2c c1-2d c1-b c1-9e c1-3m c1-5n c1-9f" style="box-sizing: inherit\; letter-spacing: inherit\; text-transform: inherit\; color: inherit\; font-weight: bold\; line-height: inherit\; font-size: inherit !important\;">ICE TIMES:</span> Teams will skate 1-3 times per week (practices and games). The weekly schedule will vary. Each team will receive approximately 35-38 ice times. The schedule will be available online once the season begins.</span></p>\n<p style="box-sizing: inherit\; margin: 0px\; color: #5e5e5e\; font-family: Roboto\, arial\, sans-serif\; font-size: 16px\;"><span style="box-sizing: inherit\;">&nbsp\;</span></p>\n<p style="box-sizing: inherit\; margin: 0px\; color: #5e5e5e\; font-family: Roboto\, arial\, sans-serif\; font-size: 16px\;"><span style="box-sizing: inherit\;"><span class="x-el x-el-span c1-2c c1-2d c1-b c1-9e c1-3m c1-5n c1-9f" style="box-sizing: inherit\; letter-spacing: inherit\; text-transform: inherit\; color: inherit\; font-weight: bold\; line-height: inherit\; font-size: inherit !important\;">ROSTERS &amp\; SCHEDULES: </span>Rosters will be assembled until after ALL the rate skates are completed. Schedules will be available in late September right before the season starts.</span></p>\n<p style="box-sizing: inherit\; margin: 0px\; color: #5e5e5e\; font-family: Roboto\, arial\, sans-serif\; font-size: 16px\;"><span style="box-sizing: inherit\;">&nbsp\;</span></p>\n<p style="box-sizing: inherit\; margin: 0px\; color: #5e5e5e\; font-family: Roboto\, arial\, sans-serif\; font-size: 16px\;"><span style="box-sizing: inherit\;"><span class="x-el x-el-span c1-2c c1-2d c1-b c1-9e c1-3m c1-5n c1-9f" style="box-sizing: inherit\; letter-spacing: inherit\; text-transform: inherit\; color: inherit\; font-weight: bold\; line-height: inherit\; font-size: inherit !important\;">MAPLE LEAFS (ALL-STARS) PROGRAM:</span>&nbsp\;&nbsp\;From the BBHL\, one all-star team will be formed at each the 10U\, 12U\, &amp\; 14U levels. Maple Leaf teams are for those looking for more ice time and a more competitive environment than their regular BBHL schedule. PLEASE NOTE THERE ARE NO TRYOUTS TO PLAY IN THE BBHL. EVERY PLAYER REGISTERED WILL BE PLACED ON A TEAM. Tryouts for the Maple Leafs All-Star teams are held in August. Players must be playing in the BBHL in order to be considered for the Maple Leafs program. In addition to the normal BBHL practice and game schedule... Maple Leaf teams will participate in approximately 12-15 additional practices and 3-4 additional tournaments. Please refer to tamohockey.com for more information regarding the Maple Leafs program.</span></p>\n<p style="box-sizing: inherit\; margin: 0px\; color: #5e5e5e\; font-family: Roboto\, arial\, sans-serif\; font-size: 16px\;"><span style="box-sizing: inherit\;">&nbsp\;</span></p>\n<p style="box-sizing: inherit\; margin: 0px\; color: #5e5e5e\; font-family: Roboto\, arial\, sans-serif\; font-size: 16px\;"><span style="box-sizing: inherit\;"><span class="x-el x-el-span c1-2c c1-2d c1-b c1-9e c1-3m c1-5n c1-9f" style="box-sizing: inherit\; letter-spacing: inherit\; text-transform: inherit\; color: inherit\; font-weight: bold\; line-height: inherit\; font-size: inherit !important\;">GIRLS:</span> Girls hockey is a priority for the club. The BBHL assembles a girls only team at the 8U level each season. Girls ages 6-9 years may be considered to assemble this girls only team. The team is placed in the BBHL for practice and game purposes.</span></p>\n<p style="box-sizing: inherit\; margin: 0px\; color: #5e5e5e\; font-family: Roboto\, arial\, sans-serif\; font-size: 16px\;"><span style="box-sizing: inherit\;">&nbsp\;</span></p>\n<p style="box-sizing: inherit\; margin: 0px\; color: #5e5e5e\; font-family: Roboto\, arial\, sans-serif\; font-size: 16px\;"><span style="box-sizing: inherit\;"><span class="x-el x-el-span c1-2c c1-2d c1-b c1-9e c1-3m c1-5n c1-9f" style="box-sizing: inherit\; letter-spacing: inherit\; text-transform: inherit\; color: inherit\; font-weight: bold\; line-height: inherit\; font-size: inherit !important\;">PLAYING FORMAT:</span> 6U/8U will practice in a station based format following the USA Hockey American Development Model. 6U games will be played cross-ice. 8U games will be played half-ice. 10U\, 12U\, &amp\; 14U will practice half-ice and play full-ice games.&nbsp\;</span></p>\n<p style="box-sizing: inherit\; margin: 0px\; color: #5e5e5e\; font-family: Roboto\, arial\, sans-serif\; font-size: 16px\;"><span style="box-sizing: inherit\;">&nbsp\;</span></p>\n<p style="box-sizing: inherit\; margin: 0px\; color: #5e5e5e\; font-family: Roboto\, arial\, sans-serif\; font-size: 16px\;"><span style="box-sizing: inherit\;"><span class="x-el x-el-span c1-2c c1-2d c1-b c1-9e c1-3m c1-5n c1-9f" style="box-sizing: inherit\; letter-spacing: inherit\; text-transform: inherit\; color: inherit\; font-weight: bold\; line-height: inherit\; font-size: inherit !important\;">USA HOCKEY MEMBERSHIP:</span> All players are required to register annually with USA Hockey for the existing playing season. Online registration can be completed at usahockey.com.</span></p>\n<p style="box-sizing: inherit\; margin: 0px\; color: #5e5e5e\; font-family: Roboto\, arial\, sans-serif\; font-size: 16px\;"><span style="box-sizing: inherit\;">&nbsp\;</span></p>\n<p style="box-sizing: inherit\; margin: 0px\; color: #5e5e5e\; font-family: Roboto\, arial\, sans-serif\; font-size: 16px\;"><span style="box-sizing: inherit\;"><span class="x-el x-el-span c1-2c c1-2d c1-b c1-9e c1-3m c1-5n c1-9f" style="box-sizing: inherit\; letter-spacing: inherit\; text-transform: inherit\; color: inherit\; font-weight: bold\; line-height: inherit\; font-size: inherit !important\;">TOLEDO WALLEYE VOUCHER FUNDRAISER:</span> Each registered player will receive five (5) Toledo Walleye game vouchers. The cost of the vouchers is included in the BBHL player fee. Families may use their vouchers or re-sell them at face value.&nbsp\;</span></p>\n<p style="box-sizing: inherit\; margin: 0px\; color: #5e5e5e\; font-family: Roboto\, arial\, sans-serif\; font-size: 16px\;"><span style="box-sizing: inherit\;">&nbsp\;</span></p>\n<p style="box-sizing: inherit\; margin: 0px\; color: #5e5e5e\; font-family: Roboto\, arial\, sans-serif\; font-size: 16px\;"><span style="box-sizing: inherit\;"><span class="x-el x-el-span c1-2c c1-2d c1-b c1-9e c1-3m c1-5n c1-9f" style="box-sizing: inherit\; letter-spacing: inherit\; text-transform: inherit\; color: inherit\; font-weight: bold\; line-height: inherit\; font-size: inherit !important\;">COACHES:</span> Head and assistant coaches are wanted. Please indicate your interest level during the online registration process.</span></p>\n<p style="box-sizing: inherit\; margin: 0px\; color: #5e5e5e\; font-family: Roboto\, arial\, sans-serif\; font-size: 16px\;"><span style="box-sizing: inherit\;">&nbsp\;</span></p>\n<p style="box-sizing: inherit\; margin: 0px\; color: #5e5e5e\; font-family: Roboto\, arial\, sans-serif\; font-size: 16px\;"><span style="box-sizing: inherit\;"><span class="x-el x-el-span c1-2c c1-2d c1-b c1-9e c1-3m c1-5n c1-9f" style="box-sizing: inherit\; letter-spacing: inherit\; text-transform: inherit\; color: inherit\; font-weight: bold\; line-height: inherit\; font-size: inherit !important\;">CARPOOLS:</span> The BBHL cannot guarantee carpool requests will be granted in the fall/winter session. There is more flexibility with carpool requests in the spring session.</span></p>\n<p style="box-sizing: inherit\; margin: 0px\; color: #5e5e5e\; font-family: Roboto\, arial\, sans-serif\; font-size: 16px\;"><span style="box-sizing: inherit\;">&nbsp\;</span></p>\n<p style="box-sizing: inherit\; margin: 0px\; color: #5e5e5e\; font-family: Roboto\, arial\, sans-serif\; font-size: 16px\;"><span style="box-sizing: inherit\;"><span class="x-el x-el-span c1-2c c1-2d c1-b c1-9e c1-3m c1-5n c1-9f" style="box-sizing: inherit\; letter-spacing: inherit\; text-transform: inherit\; color: inherit\; font-weight: bold\; line-height: inherit\; font-size: inherit !important\;">BBHL DIRECTOR:</span> Questions and concerns may be directed to <a class="x-el x-el-a c1-2c c1-2d c1-9i c1-1c c1-1d c1-2e c1-z c1-7f c1-b c1-77 c1-2l c1-9j c1-9k" style="box-sizing: inherit\; background-color: transparent\; color: #b21f26\; cursor: pointer\; overflow-wrap: break-word\; letter-spacing: inherit\; text-transform: inherit\; display: inline\; font-weight: inherit\; font-size: unset\;" href="mailto:grant@sylvaniatamoshanter.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">grant@sylvaniatamoshanter.com</a>.</span></p>\n<div><span style="box-sizing: inherit\;">&nbsp\;</span></div>\nRink: Tam-O-Shanter Ice Rink – Sylvania\, OH\n~58 mi from Ann Arbor\nPrice: $10\nSource: DaySmart\nInfo: https://apps.daysmartrecreation.com/dash/x/#/online/tamoshanter/event-registration\nConfirm with rink — schedule subject to change.
LOCATION:Tam-O-Shanter Ice Rink – Sylvania\, OH
URL:https://apps.daysmartrecreation.com/dash/x/#/online/tamoshanter/event-registration
END:VEVENT
