\; background-color: transparent\; color: #b21f26\; cursor: pointer\; overflow-wrap: break-word\; letter-spacing: inherit\; text-transform: inherit\; display: inline\; font-weight: inherit\; font-size: unset\;" href="mailto:grant@sylvaniatamoshanter.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">grant@sylvaniatamoshanter.com</a>.</span></p>\n<div><span style="box-sizing: inherit\;">&nbsp\;</span></div>\nRink: Tam-O-Shanter Ice Rink – Sylvania\, OH\n~58 mi from Ann Arbor\nPrice: $10\nSource: DaySmart\nInfo: https://apps.daysmartrecreation.com/dash/x/#/online/tamoshanter/event-registration\nConfirm with rink — schedule subject to change.
